items.description:
1.Create visually stunning UIs, 2D animations and VFX for in-game assets, cutscenes etc;
2.Collaborate with the game development team to ensure all assets meet technical requirements and performance standards;
3.Conceptualize and develop original animation ideas that best suit a casual mobile game;
4.Maintain a consistent and high-quality aesthetic across all game elements.
5.Identify and optimize animation creation processes by leveraging best practices and tools.
6.Stay current on industry trends, technologies, and emerging techniques in animation.

items.requirements:
1.5+ years of experience in western casual or mid-core games mobile game development; Familiar with Western-style game art.
2.A complete experience in mobile game development with Unity; 
3.Capability to independently create UIs, 2D animations and VFX etc;
4.Modesty and respect when receiving feedback from your team;
5.Passion for games!
